cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use mismap-qc in work you publish, please cite it.
title: "mismap-qc: missing-data validation for proteomics and RNA-Seq"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for missing-data validation in proteomics and RNA-Seq
  experiments. Runs QC checks for sample completeness, outlier samples,
  MNAR versus MAR dropout mechanism, batch effects and run-order drift,
  returns a structured report that can gate a pipeline, and pairs every
  check with a matching plot.
type: software
